ck" aria-label="Place 1">1</span></li><li class="place place-3" style="--d: 0ms;"><span class="avatar " style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="who">Dev</span><b class="money">0 izzat</b><span class="block" aria-label="Place 3">3</span></li></ol><ol class="also-ran" start="4"><li value="4"><span>Bilal</span><b>12 izzat</b></li></ol><div class="row gameover-next"><button type="button" class="btn primary big">Play again</button><button type="button" class="btn big" title="Back to the lobby with the same players: change the theme, cast, clock or players">Change setup</button></div></div></section><aside class="side ph-side"><section class="ph-purse" aria-label="Your izzat"><h2>Your izzat <b>16</b></h2><div class="ph-tokens"><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v1">1</span><span class="ph-chip v2">2</span><span class="ph-chip v2">2</span><span class="ph-chip v2">2</span><span class="ph-chip v3">3</span></div><p class="muted small">Everyone’s tokens show now.</p></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-end">Chitra won.</li><li class="log-climb">Chitra moved up from the Secretary’s chair to the Chairman’s cabin.</li><li class="log-climb">Dev moved up from the Managing committee to the Chairman’s cabin.</li><li class="log-climb">You moved up from the Lift committee to the Garden committee and took 2 izzat.</li><li class="log-fail">The vote failed: Bilal stays in the Festival committee.</li><li class="log-vote">Dev voted no.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

