div><div class="poster-tag">The war takes the whole second half.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Sena Ki Sick Leave, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Sena Ki Sick Leave — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#fcfb0069</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Sena Ki Sick Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Ten thousand extras. One close-up.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Sinhasan Musical Chairs, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Fixed Price (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Sinhasan Musical Chairs — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Fixed Price"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#27142434</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Sinhasan Musical Chairs</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The elephants got top billing.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button></div></div></div></section><aside class="side"><section class="star-race" aria-label="Box Office Chart"><h2><span class="chart-title