s="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Pappu Pandey films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: +30" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Pappu Pandey, past seasons: Sankranti: +30"><i class="t0">30</i></button></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural<em class="held"> · 2 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Tantrik Tiwari films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: –" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari, past seasons: Sankranti: –"><i class="none">–</i></button></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic<em class="held"> · 4 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Rajkumari Ratnavali films played this season yet">–</span><button class="trophies" title="Sankranti: +20" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali, past seasons: Sankranti: +20"><i class="t1">20</i></button></li></ol></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-round">Summer begins. Everyone gets 4 new films. <b>Dev</b> goes first.</li><li class="log-shelved"><b class="you">You</b> play <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Padosi Ki Bhains</span></span>. Overexposed! The 5th film is stuck with the Censor Board forever.</li><li class="log-sold"><b class="you">You</b> buy <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Suitcase Badal Gaya</span></span><span> + <span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #2f9c84;">Group Photo Mein Gadbad</span></span> from <b>Chitra</b> for ₹18 cr</li><li class="log-sold"><b>Dev</b> buys <span><span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Pyaar Via Bluetooth</span></span><span> + <span class="lot-name" style="border-color: #c9577f;">Long Distance Ladoo</span></span> from <b>Bilal</b> for ₹7 cr</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section></aside></div>"`;

