e" aria-hidden="true">#52709cb3</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Senapati On Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Seven wars. Nine songs.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays."><span class="type-icon">=</span> Fixed Price<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Fixed Price: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">You set the price…</div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: You<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Dev</b></span><span class="hint"> · The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-fixed" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop now me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You 🔨</span><span class="stop-state">pricing</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar your-turn"><form class="bidbox"><div class="bid-amount"><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One less">−</button><label class="amount"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true">₹</span><input inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-label="Set price amount" type="text" value="10"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"> cr</span><span class="of">of ₹100 cr</span></label><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One more">+</button></div><div class="quick"><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+5</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+10</button></div><div class="act-row"><button class="btn primary big">Set price ₹10 cr <kbd>Enter</kbd></button></div><p class="hint">If nobody buys at your price, you pay it to the bank and keep the lot.</p></form></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra</option><option value="1">You (seller)</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="0"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me owing   " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin: can call results agreed on voice">★</span><span class="mark now">pricing</span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="1" aria-label="You have bought no films this season" title="You have bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><h2>Your hand <small>8</small></h2><button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="What the auction icons mean"><i class="i-dot">i</i> <span>Icons</span></button><span class="grow"></span><span class="money" title="Your money (only you can see it)">₹100 cr</span></div><div class="hand"><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="group-label">✸ BB <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Kaanoon Ka Thappad, Bijli Bhullar, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1e0f0c; --h: #d0583f; --t: #f7dccf;" title="Kaanoon Ka Thappad — Bijli Bhullar (Action) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#85c61fd8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">BB</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Bijli Bhullar</div><div class="poster-title">Kaanoon Ka Thappad</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Rated A for Acceleration.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#92dc58e6</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="group-label">♥ KK <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Chiffon Mein Chills, Kajal Khurana, Sealed Bid (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1f0d17; --h: #c9577f; --t: #f8d9e5;" title="Chiffon Mein Chills — Kajal Khurana (Rom-com) — Sealed Bid"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e6a9e1e8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>✉</b><span>Sealed Bid</span></div><div class="poster-code">KK</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Kajal Khurana</div><div class="poster-title">Chiffon Mein Chills</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">She missed the train. He bought the station.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#2f4c4f0f</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="group-label">● PP <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana, Pappu Pandey, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#f1dadcfe</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Based on the family WhatsApp group.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Padosi Ki Bhains, Pappu Pandey, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Padosi Ki Bhains — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#523f4128</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Padosi Ki Bhains</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Fufaji walked out of the trailer.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="group-label">☠ TT <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Haveli No. 13, Tantrik Tiwari, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Haveli No. 13 — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#711998f8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Haveli No. 13</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The haveli has no reviews. For a reason.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Saaya Society, Tantrik Tiwari, Fixed Price (view)"