168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#52709cb3</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Senapati On Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Seven wars. Nine songs.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays."><span class="type-icon">=</span> Fixed Price<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Fixed Price: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price"><b>₹17 cr</b><span>take it or leave it</span></div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: You<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Dev</b></span><span class="hint"> · The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-fixed" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop now "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state">₹17 cr?</span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You 🔨</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar "><p class="status">Waiting for Dev…</p></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra</option><option value="1">You (seller)</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="17"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me    " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div 