billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Group Photo Mein Gadbad</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">A comedy of errors, mostly by the scriptwriter.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays."><span class="type-icon">=</span> Fixed Price<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Fixed Price: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price"><b>₹18 cr</b><span>take it or leave it</span></div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: Chitra<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>You</b></span><span class="hint"> · The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-fixed" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop now me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You</span><span class="stop-state">₹18 cr?</span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" a