/span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg><span><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg><span><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural</small></span></li><li><svg class="star-face" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg><span><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic</small></span></li></ul><p class="muted small">Picked at random from 7. Every star gets new names each game.</p></section></details><div class="row"><button class="btn big grow primary" aria-pressed="false">I’m ready</button><button class="btn">Leave</button></div><p class="muted small">The admin starts the game. Seats are drawn at random when the game begins, and nobody new sits down after that.</p><details class="rules"><summary>How to play</summary><ul><li>On your turn, put one film from your hand up for auction. The winner pays <b>you</b>; if you win your own auction, you pay the bank.</li><li>The season ends the moment card number 5 of one star is played. That film is not sold.</li><li>The three stars with the most films played that season score ₹30 cr / ₹20 cr / ₹10 cr per film (All-Time Blockbuster / Superhit / Semi-Hit). Ties go to the star higher on the chart.</li><li>The bank then buys every film you bought this season at its star’s value: this season’s score <b>plus that star’s scores from earlier seasons</b>. A star outside the top three pays nothing, whatever it earned before.</li><li>4 seasons. Most seasons start with new films dealt to everyone (see “The deck and the deal”); unplayed films stay in your hand. Most money at the end wins.</li></ul><dl><div><dt><b class="type-icon">⇈</b> Open Auction</dt><dd>Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">↻</b> Once Around</dt><dd>One bid each, going round the table. The seller bids last.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">✉</b> Sealed Bid</dt><dd>Everyone bids in secret, once. Highest wins; a tie goes to the seller, then clockwise.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">=</b> Fixed Price</dt><dd>The seller names a price. First player round the table to accept buys it; if nobody does, the seller pays.</dd></div><div><dt><b class="type-icon">×2</b> Double Feature</dt><dd>Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</dd></div></dl></details><details class="rules"><summary>The deck and the deal</summary><div class="deck-info"><p class="hint">70 films in the game. Each star has this many of each auction type:</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Star</th><th title="Open Auction"><span class="type-icon">⇈</span></th><th title="Once Around"><span class="type-icon">↻</span></th><th title="Sealed Bid"><span class="type-icon">✉</span></th><th title="Fixed Price"><span class="type-icon">=</span></th><th title="Double Feature"><span class="type-icon">×2</span></th><th>All</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #d0583f; --suit-ink: #fff;">✸ Bijli Bhullar</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>2</td><td><b>12</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #c9577f; --suit-ink: #fff;">♥ Kajal Khurana</span></th><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>13</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #2f9c84; --suit-ink: #03211b;">● Pappu Pandey</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td><b>14</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #9cbd34; --suit-ink: #1a2303;">☠ Tantrik Tiwari</span></th><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>15</b></td></tr><tr><th class="left"><span class="suit-chip" style="--suit: #a35cc2; --suit-ink: #fff;">♛ Rajkumari Ratnavali</span></th><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td><b>16</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Films dealt to each player at the start of each season. Unplayed films carry over; the rest are never dealt.</p><div class="scroll-x"><table class="results deck-table"><thead><tr><th class="left">Players</th><th>Sankranti</th><th>Summer</th><th>Eid</th><th>Diwali</th><th>Never dealt</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><th class="left">3</th><td>10</td><td>+6</td><td>+6</td><td>—</td><td>4</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">4</th><td>9</td><td>+4</td><td>+4</td><td>—</td><td>2</td></tr><tr class=""><th class="left">5</th><td>8</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td><td>—</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Icons: ⇈ Open Auction · ↻ Once Around · ✉ Sealed Bid · = Fixed Price · ×2 Double Feature.</p></div></details></main>"`;

exports[`room pages > offer-buying 1`] = `"<div class="table  "><header class="topbar"><span class="brand"><a class="brand-link" href="/" title="Home">Game Adda</a></span><button type="button" class="round round-btn" title="All seasons: the deal, the scoring and where the game is" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg class="round-ring" viewBox="0 0 22 22" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true">#2cbf88b0</svg><b>Sankranti</b> · season 1 of 4</button><span class="grow"></span><button class="icon-btn" title="Freeze the game: the clock, the bots and all moves wait" aria-label="Freeze the game"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><path d="M12 3v18M4.2 7.5l15.6 9M4.2 16.5l15.6-9"></path><path d="M9.5 4.5L12 7l2.5-2.5M9.5 19.5L12 17l2.5 2.5"></path></svg> <span class="lbl">Freeze</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Auction log" aria-label="Auction log">☰ <span class="lbl">Log</span></button><button class="icon-btn" title="Sound on" aria-label="Turn sound off">🔊</button><button class="icon-btn" aria-expanded="false" title="Room and rules" aria-label="Room and rules">? <span class="lbl">Room</span></button></header><div class="notices"></div><section class="seats arc" aria-label="Players"><div class="seat     " data-seat="2" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Dev"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Dev</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="8 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>8</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="2" aria-label="Dev has bought no films this season" title="Dev has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal<span class="mark now">deciding</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">Sells next</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><div class="owned" data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal has bought no films this season" title="Bilal has bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><div class="seat     " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra</div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="9 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>9</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra bought 1 film: 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div></section><section class="stage  stage-offer"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Wedding Mein Wrong Number — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Double Feature"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e0d1bb8d</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>×2</b><span>Double Feature</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Wedding Mein Wrong Number</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Every uncle thinks he is the hero.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></div><div class="slot-empty">+ ?</div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction."><span class="type-icon">×2</span> Double Feature<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Double Feature: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">Who adds a second Pappu Pandey film?</div><div class="seller">🔨 Dev played it alone<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>Bilal</b></span><span class="hint"> · Add a second film of the same star; both sell together using the second film’s auction.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-offer" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop now "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state">+ ?</span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev 🔨</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar "><p class="status">Waiting for Bilal…</p></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><div class="ruling-row"><button class="btn">Nobody adds…</button><p class="hint">The second card must come from someone’s hand, so it cannot be called. Ask them to add it themselves.</p></div></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me    " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin: can call results agreed on voice">★</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards">You sell in 3 lots</div><div class="owned" data-owned="1" aria-label="You have bought no films this season" title="You have bought no films this season"><span class="mini-card empty" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></div><h2>Your hand <small>8</small></h2><button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="What the auction icons mean"><i class="i-dot">i</i> <span>Icons</span></button><span class="grow"></span><span class="money" title="Your money (only you can see it)">₹117 cr</span></div><div class="hand"><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="group-label">✸ BB <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Kaanoon Ka Thappad, Bijli Bhullar, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1e0f0c; --h: #d0583f; --t: #f7dccf;" title="Kaanoon Ka Thappad — Bijli Bhullar (Action) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#85c61fd8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">BB</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Bijli Bhullar</div><div class="poster-title">Kaanoon Ka Thappad</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Rated A for Acceleration.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#92dc58e6</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="group-label">♥ KK <b>×1</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Chiffon Mein Chills, Kajal Khurana, Sealed Bid (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #1f0d17; --h: #c9577f; --t: #f8d9e5;" title="Chiffon Mein Chills — Kajal Khurana (Rom-com) — Sealed Bid"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#e6a9e1e8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>✉</b><span>Sealed Bid</span></div><div class="poster-code">KK</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Kajal Khurana</div><div class="poster-title">Chiffon Mein Chills</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">She missed the train. He bought the station.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#2f4c4f0f</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="group-label">● PP <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana, Pappu Pandey, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#f1dadcfe</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Shaadi Mein Zaroor Khana</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Based on the family WhatsApp group.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Padosi Ki Bhains, Pappu Pandey, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #071b17; --h: #2f9c84; --t: #d2efe5;" title="Padosi Ki Bhains — Pappu Pandey (Family comedy) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#523f4128</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">PP</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Pappu Pandey</div><div class="poster-title">Padosi Ki Bhains</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Fufaji walked out of the trailer.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#c51b0c8d</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="group-label">☠ TT <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Haveli No. 13, Tantrik Tiwari, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Haveli No. 13 — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#711998f8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Haveli No. 13</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The haveli has no reviews. For a reason.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Saaya Society, Tantrik Tiwari, Fixed Price (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Saaya Society — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Fixed Price"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#939f1937</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Saaya Society</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The swing moves. The budget doesn’t.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="group-label">♛ RR <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Diwan-e-Drama, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Diwan-e-Drama — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#648b953f</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Diwan-e-Drama</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The CGI army has a union.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Sena Ki Sick Leave, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Sena Ki Sick Leave — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#fcfb0069</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Sena Ki Sick Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Ten thousand extras. One close-up.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button></div></div></div></section><aside class="side"><section class="star-race" aria-label="Box Office Chart"><h2><span class="chart-title">Box Office Chart<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="How to read the Box Office Chart"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></span><small>5th film of a star ends the season</small></h2><ol class="star-rows"><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Bijli Bhullar films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Kajal Khurana films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row    " style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy<em class="held"> · 2 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="What one Pappu Pandey film would pay if the season ended now: ₹30 cr as All-Time Blockbuster, plus its scores from earlier seasons">₹30 cr<small>All-Time Blockbuster</small></span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural<em class="held"> · 2 in you