itle="Haveli No. 13 — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#711998f8</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Haveli No. 13</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The haveli has no reviews. For a reason.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Saaya Society, Tantrik Tiwari, Fixed Price (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #141a07; --h: #9cbd34; --t: #eaf3c8;" title="Saaya Society — Tantrik Tiwari (Supernatural) — Fixed Price"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#939f1937</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>=</b><span>Fixed Price</span></div><div class="poster-code">TT</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Tantrik Tiwari</div><div class="poster-title">Saaya Society</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The swing moves. The budget doesn’t.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#1ee3dcbe</svg></div></button></div></div><div class="hand-group" style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="group-label">♛ RR <b>×2</b></span><div class="fan"><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Diwan-e-Drama, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Open Auction (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Diwan-e-Drama — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#648b953f</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Diwan-e-Drama</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">The CGI army has a union.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button><button class="hand-card      inspectable" aria-label="Sena Ki Sick Leave, Rajkumari Ratnavali, Once Around (view)"><div class="poster poster-md bo" style="--g: #180c1f; --h: #a35cc2; --t: #eedaf7;" title="Sena Ki Sick Leave — Rajkumari Ratnavali (Period epic) — Once Around"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#fcfb0069</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>↻</b><span>Once Around</span></div><div class="poster-code">RR</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Rajkumari Ratnavali</div><div class="poster-title">Sena Ki Sick Leave</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Ten thousand extras. One close-up.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#e857fad5</svg></div></button></div></div></div></section><aside class="side"><section class="star-race" aria-label="Box Office Chart"><h2><span class="chart-title">Box Office Chart<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="How to read the Box Office Chart"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></span><small>5th film of a star ends the season</small></h2><ol class="star-rows"><li class="star-row    " style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action<em class="held"> · 1 in your hand</em></small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag"