llar, 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #d0583f; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">✸</span><span class="mc-short">BB</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="3" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Bilal"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span></button></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Bilal<span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="3" aria-label="Bilal bought 2 films: 2 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n2" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span><b class="mc-count">2</b></span></button></div></div><div class="seat  owing   " data-seat="0" style="--arc: 0.500;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About Chitra"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span></button><span class="role" title="Seller">🔨</span></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">Chitra<span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-line"><span class="backs" title="7 films in hand"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>7</b></span></div><button class="owned " data-owned="0" aria-label="Chitra bought 2 films: 1 Pappu Pandey, 1 Rajkumari Ratnavali" aria-expanded="false"><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #2f9c84; color: #03211b;"><span class="mc-glyph">●</span><span class="mc-short">PP</span></span><span class="mini-card n1" style="--suit: #a35cc2; color: #fff;"><span class="mc-glyph">♛</span><span class="mc-short">RR</span></span></button></div></div></section><section class="stage owing stage-open"><div class="lot-row"><div class="lot-posters"><div><div class="poster poster-lg bo" style="--g: #1f0d17; --h: #c9577f; --t: #f8d9e5;" title="Rishta Via Resume — Kajal Khurana (Rom-com) — Open Auction"><svg class="poster-art" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">#2c48d011</svg><div class="poster-type"><b>⇈</b><span>Open Auction</span></div><div class="poster-code">KK</div><div class="poster-foot"><div class="bo-billing">Kajal Khurana</div><div class="poster-title">Rishta Via Resume</div><div class="bo-rule"></div><div class="poster-tag">Bauji said no. The violins said yes.</div></div><svg class="bo-frame" viewBox="0 0 120 168" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">#2f4c4f0f</svg></div></div></div><div class="lot-info"><div class="kind-label" title="Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out."><span class="type-icon">⇈</span> Open Auction<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="Open Auction: how auction types work"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></div><div class="price muted-price">No bids yet</div><div class="seller">🔨 Seller: Chitra<span class="next-seller" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who still has cards"> · Next seller: <b>You</b></span><span class="hint"> · Anyone can raise at any time. Done takes you out until you bid again. It sells when everyone else is done or the bid timer runs out.</span></div><ol class="rail rail-open" aria-label="Order round the table"><li class="stop waiting me"><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">You</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#0fd19d14</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Dev</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra 🔨</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li></ol></div></div><div class="action-bar your-turn"><form class="bidbox"><div class="bid-amount"><button type="button" class="step" disabled="" aria-label="One less">−</button><label class="amount"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true">₹</span><input inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-label="Bid amount" type="text" value="1"><span class="cur" aria-hidden="true"> cr</span><span class="of">of ₹118 cr</span></label><button type="button" class="step" aria-label="One more">+</button></div><div class="quick"><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+5</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn">+10</button><button type="button" class="chip-btn" disabled="">min</button></div><div class="act-row"><button class="btn primary big">Bid ₹1 cr <kbd>Enter</kbd></button><button type="button" class="btn big timed">No bid <kbd>Esc</kbd><span class="bid-clock  " title="When this runs out, everyone still in is done"><span class="secs">12s</span><span class="drain" aria-hidden="true"><span style="animation-duration: 30000ms; animation-delay: -18000ms; animation-play-state: running;"></span></span></span></button></div></form></div><details class="ruling"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">🔨</span> Call it from voice <small>admin</small></summary><form class="ruling-row"><label>Sold to<select><option value="0">Chitra (seller)</option><option value="1">You</option><option value="2">Dev</option><option value="3">Bilal</option><option value="none">Nobody (seller keeps it free)</option></select></label><label>for<input class="ruling-price" inputmode="numeric" type="text" value="0"></label><button class="btn">Call it…</button><p class="hint">Ends this auction now, whatever the buttons say. Everyone sees that you called it. You can undo it until anyone moves.</p></form></details></section><section class="hand-panel  "><div class="hand-head"><div class="seat me owing   " data-seat="1" style="--arc: 1.000;"><div class="avatar-wrap"><button class="avatar-btn" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="About your seat"><span class="avatar on" title="Connected" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span></button><div class="react-bar"><button type="button" class="react-badge " aria-expanded="false" title="React: float an emoji over your seat" aria-label="React"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M8.5 14a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 7 0"></path><path d="M9.5 9.8h0M14.5 9.8h0" stroke-width="2.6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="seat-body"><div class="seat-name">You<span class="admin-mark" title="Room admin: can call results agreed on voice">★</span><span class="mark now">bidding</span></div><div class="seat-tag" title="The hammer passes clockwise to the next player who st