iting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e3ecf7, #c4d4ec);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#b20bad4c</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Bilal</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop waiting "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #e6f2e3, #c3ddbf);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#f53baf90</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Chitra</span><span class="stop-state"></span></li><li class="stop now "><span class="avatar small" style="background: linear-gradient(170deg, #f4e1ea, #e3bfd0);"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">#2bb40ffe</svg></span><span class="stop-name">Asha 🔨</span><span class="stop-state">pricing</span></li></ol></div></div></section><aside class="side"><section class="star-race" aria-label="Box Office Chart"><h2><span class="chart-title">Box Office Chart<button class="info-btn tap-only" aria-label="How to read the Box Office Chart"><i class="i-dot">i</i></button></span><small>5th film of a star ends the season</small></h2><ol class="star-rows"><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #d0583f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Bijli Bhullar">#1884e3e6</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Bijli Bhullar</b><small>✸ Action</small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Bijli Bhullar films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #c9577f;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Kajal Khurana">#a8d6436d</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Kajal Khurana</b><small>♥ Rom-com</small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Kajal Khurana films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #2f9c84;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Pappu Pandey">#b5d1cfc0</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Pappu Pandey</b><small>● Family comedy</small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Pappu Pandey films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row  flat  " style="--suit: #9cbd34;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Tantrik Tiwari">#d46d8bdb</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Tantrik Tiwari</b><small>☠ Supernatural</small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="0 of 5 films this season"><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="No Tantrik Tiwari films played this season yet">–</span></li><li class="star-row    " style="--suit: #a35cc2;"><span class="face"><svg class="star-face" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Rajkumari Ratnavali">#dcbccd72</svg></span><span class="who"><b>Rajkumari Ratnavali</b><small>♛ Period epic</small></span><span class="reel" aria-label="1 of 5 films this season"><i class="on"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class="last"></i></span><span class="tag" title="What one Rajkumari Ratnavali film would pay if the season ended now: ₹30 cr as All-Time Blockbuster, plus its scores from earlier seasons">₹30 cr<small>All-Time Blockbuster</small></span></li></ol></section><section class="recent" aria-label="Latest"><h2>Latest</h2><ol><li class="log-round">Sankranti begins. Everyone is dealt 9 films. <b>Asha</b> goes first.</li></ol><button class="btn small ghost">Full log</button></section>